iv><div class="preview-order"><span id="preview-item">Maple oat latte <small>× 1</small></span><span id="preview-price">$5.50</span></div><div class="preview-total"><span id="total-label">Total paid</span><strong id="preview-total">$5.50 <small>USD</small></strong></div><div class="preview-signature" id="preview-signature"><span>◇</span><div>Ready for your signature<small>A little trust, waiting to happen.</small></div></div><div class="preview-bottom">THANKS FOR MAKING US PART OF YOUR DAY.<span>the daily grind ♥</span></div></div><button id="download" class="download-button" disabled>↓ &nbsp; Download signed document</button><p class="preview-help">A keepsake you can share. A signature anyone can check.</p></aside></div><div class="key-bar"><div><span class="key-symbol">⚿</span><div><strong>Your browser’s signing key</strong><small id="key-info">Creating your private signing key…</small></div></div><div class="key-actions"><button id="export-key">Export public key ↗</button><label for="import-key">Import trusted key <span>↥</span><input type="file" id="import-key" accept=".json,application/json" hidden></label></div></div><p class="trust-note">A valid signature confirms a document was signed by the trusted key and hasn’t changed. For café-issued documents, obtain the café’s public key through a trusted channel. Browser-created documents are local demonstrations, not proof of purchase or redeemable credit.</p></section>
